          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 91 SW              MARSWORTH         VICARAGE ROAD 6/112                                   No. 78 (Cottesloe) 18.9.78 GV                                      II House.  C17, altered, and restored c. 1980.  Timber frame with colourwashed render infill and brick plinth.  Right gable rebuilt in pale brick C19.  Tiled roof, old brick chimney between left bays, later chimney to left of right bay.  One storey and attic, 3 bays, the right bay slightly taller.  Wooden casements with single horizontal glazing bars, 3-light to ground floor, 2-light in gabled eaves-line dormers. First floor of left bay also has blocked original 3-light window with chamfered and narrow mullions.  C20 lean-to porch projection between right bays has 2 single lights with cast iron lattice glazing bars to front, and C20 door in pointed arch to right side.  C20 extension at right-angles to rear. Listing NGR: SP9198214689"
    }
  ],
